    task: "Thames Logistics caches courier rates in a long transaction. Build class `RateCardCache` - a least-recently-used cache.\n- `public RateCardCache(Integer capacity)` - throw IllegalArgumentException if capacity is null or < 1\n- `public Decimal get(String key)` - returns null if absent; a hit makes the key most recently used\n- `public void put(String key, Decimal value)` - insert or update (update also counts as use); when full, evict the least recently used key first\n- `public Integer size()`\nUse only Apex collections (no custom objects / Platform Cache).",
    starter: "public with sharing class RateCardCache {\n    public RateCardCache(Integer capacity) {\n        // TODO\n    }\n\n    public Decimal get(String key) {\n        // TODO\n        return null;\n    }\n\n    public void put(String key, Decimal value) {\n        // TODO\n    }\n\n    public Integer size() {\n        // TODO\n        return 0;\n    }\n}\n",
    solution: "public with sharing class RateCardCache {\n    private final Integer capacity;\n    private final Map<String, Decimal> store = new Map<String, Decimal>();\n    private final List<String> usage = new List<String>();\n\n    public RateCardCache(Integer capacity) {\n        if (capacity == null || capacity < 1) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException('Capacity must be at least 1');\n        }\n        this.capacity = capacity;\n    }\n\n    public Decimal get(String key) {\n        if (!store.containsKey(key)) return null;\n        touch(key);\n        return store.get(key);\n    }\n\n    public void put(String key, Decimal value) {\n        if (store.containsKey(key)) {\n            touch(key);\n        } else {\n            if (store.size() == capacity) {\n                String eldest = usage.remove(0);\n                store.remove(eldest);\n            }\n            usage.add(key);\n        }\n        store.put(key, value);\n    }\n\n    public Integer size() {\n        return store.size();\n    }\n\n    private void touch(String key) {\n        Integer idx = usage.indexOf(key);\n        if (idx >= 0) usage.remove(idx);\n        usage.add(key);\n    }\n}\n",
