    solution: "public with sharing class PhoneValidator {\n    private static final Pattern UK_MOBILE = Pattern.compile('^(?:\\\\+44|0044|0)(7\\\\d{9})$');\n\n    public static String toE164(String raw) {\n        if (String.isBlank(raw)) return null;\n        String cleaned = raw.replaceAll('[\\\\s\\\\-()]', '');\n        Matcher m = UK_MOBILE.matcher(cleaned);\n        if (!m.matches()) return null;\n        return '+44' + m.group(1);\n    }\n}\n",
