    solution: "public with sharing class CaseRefParser {\n    private static final Pattern REF = Pattern.compile('(?i)\\\\bBW-\\\\d{6}\\\\b');\n\n    public static List<String> extractRefs(String body) {\n        List<String> refs = new List<String>();\n        if (String.isBlank(body)) return refs;\n        Set<String> seen = new Set<String>();\n        Matcher m = REF.matcher(body);\n        while (m.find()) {\n            String ref = m.group().toUpperCase();\n            if (seen.add(ref)) refs.add(ref);\n        }\n        return refs;\n    }\n}\n",
