    task: "Thames Logistics moves stock between warehouses. Custom objects: Warehouse__c (Stock__c number) and Stock_Movement__c (From_Warehouse__c, To_Warehouse__c lookups, Quantity__c).\nWrite `public static void transfer(Id fromId, Id toId, Integer qty)` in class `StockTransferService` with inner `StockTransferException`.\n- Throw StockTransferException for same/null Ids, qty <= 0, missing warehouse or insufficient stock\n- Lock both warehouse rows (FOR UPDATE) in one query\n- Update both warehouses and insert a Stock_Movement__c\n- If any DML fails, roll back to a savepoint and throw StockTransferException with the DmlException as cause",
    starter: "public with sharing class StockTransferService {\n    public static void transfer(Id fromId, Id toId, Integer qty) {\n        // TODO\n    }\n}\n",
    solution: "public with sharing class StockTransferService {\n    public class StockTransferException extends Exception {}\n\n    public static void transfer(Id fromId, Id toId, Integer qty) {\n        if (fromId == null || toId == null || fromId == toId) {\n            throw new StockTransferException('Two different warehouses are required');\n        }\n        if (qty == null || qty <= 0) {\n            throw new StockTransferException('Quantity must be positive');\n        }\n        Set<Id> ids = new Set<Id>{ fromId, toId };\n        Map<Id, Warehouse__c> warehouses = new Map<Id, Warehouse__c>([\n            SELECT Id, Stock__c\n            FROM Warehouse__c\n            WHERE Id IN :ids\n            WITH USER_MODE\n            FOR UPDATE\n        ]);\n        if (warehouses.size() != 2) {\n            throw new StockTransferException('Warehouse not found');\n        }\n        Warehouse__c source = warehouses.get(fromId);\n        Warehouse__c target = warehouses.get(toId);\n        Decimal available = source.Stock__c == null ? 0 : source.Stock__c;\n        if (available < qty) {\n            throw new StockTransferException('Insufficient stock: ' + available + ' available');\n        }\n        source.Stock__c = available - qty;\n        target.Stock__c = (target.Stock__c == null ? 0 : target.Stock__c) + qty;\n        List<Warehouse__c> changed = new List<Warehouse__c>{ source, target };\n        Stock_Movement__c movement = new Stock_Movement__c(\n            From_Warehouse__c = fromId,\n            To_Warehouse__c = toId,\n            Quantity__c = qty\n        );\n\n        Savepoint sp = Database.setSavepoint();\n        try {\n            update as user changed;\n            insert as user movement;\n        } catch (DmlException e) {\n            Database.rollback(sp);\n            throw new StockTransferException('Transfer failed: ' + e.getDmlMessage(0), e);\n        }\n    }\n}\n",
