    task: "Brightwell Energy sends outage notices by SMS and email.\n- `public abstract class Notifier` with a public `List<String> outbox`, a public non-overridable `send(String recipient, String body)` that throws IllegalArgumentException for blank args, then calls `deliver(recipient, format(body))`\n- `protected virtual String format(String body)` trims the body\n- `protected abstract void deliver(String recipient, String message)`\n- `SmsNotifier`: format also truncates to 160 chars (157 + '...'); deliver adds 'SMS to <r>: <m>' to outbox\n- `EmailNotifier`: deliver throws IllegalArgumentException if recipient has no '@', else adds 'EMAIL to <r>: <m>'",
    starter: "public abstract class Notifier {\n    // TODO\n}\n\npublic class SmsNotifier {\n    // TODO\n}\n\npublic class EmailNotifier {\n    // TODO\n}\n",
    solution: "public abstract class Notifier {\n    public List<String> outbox = new List<String>();\n\n    public void send(String recipient, String body) {\n        if (String.isBlank(recipient) || String.isBlank(body)) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException('Recipient and body are required');\n        }\n        deliver(recipient, format(body));\n    }\n\n    protected virtual String format(String body) {\n        return body.trim();\n    }\n\n    protected abstract void deliver(String recipient, String message);\n}\n\npublic class SmsNotifier extends Notifier {\n    protected override String format(String body) {\n        String text = super.format(body);\n        return text.length() > 160 ? text.left(157) + '...' : text;\n    }\n\n    protected override void deliver(String recipient, String message) {\n        outbox.add('SMS to ' + recipient + ': ' + message);\n    }\n}\n\npublic class EmailNotifier extends Notifier {\n    protected override void deliver(String recipient, String message) {\n        if (!recipient.contains('@')) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException('Invalid email: ' + recipient);\n        }\n        outbox.add('EMAIL to ' + recipient + ': ' + message);\n    }\n}\n",
