    solution: "public with sharing class VatCalculator {\n    private static final Decimal VAT_RATE = 0.20;\n\n    public static Map<String, Decimal> breakdown(Decimal gross) {\n        if (gross == null || gross < 0) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException('Gross amount must be zero or more');\n        }\n        Decimal grossRounded = gross.setScale(2, System.RoundingMode.HALF_UP);\n        Decimal net = grossRounded.divide(1 + VAT_RATE, 2, System.RoundingMode.HALF_UP);\n        return new Map<String, Decimal>{\n            'gross' => grossRounded,\n            'net' => net,\n            'vat' => grossRounded - net\n        };\n    }\n}\n",
