    solution: "public with sharing class DeliverySlots {\n    private static final String LONDON = 'Europe/London';\n    private static final Date KNOWN_MONDAY = Date.newInstance(1900, 1, 1);\n\n    public static String toLondonLabel(Datetime slot) {\n        if (slot == null) return null;\n        return slot.format('EEE d MMM HH:mm', LONDON);\n    }\n\n    public static Boolean isWithinWorkingHours(Datetime slot) {\n        if (slot == null) return false;\n        Date localDate = Date.valueOf(slot.format('yyyy-MM-dd', LONDON));\n        Integer dayIndex = Math.mod(KNOWN_MONDAY.daysBetween(localDate), 7);\n        if (dayIndex > 4) return false;\n        Integer hour = Integer.valueOf(slot.format('H', LONDON));\n        return hour >= 8 && hour < 18;\n    }\n}\n",
