    starter: "public with sharing class SlaCalculator {\n    public static Id defaultBusinessHoursId() {\n        // TODO\n        return null;\n    }\n\n    public static Datetime dueDate(Id businessHoursId, Datetime startTime, Integer workingHours) {\n        // TODO\n        return null;\n    }\n\n    public static Decimal elapsedWorkingHours(Id businessHoursId, Datetime startTime, Datetime endTime) {\n        // TODO\n        return 0;\n    }\n}\n",
    solution: "public with sharing class SlaCalculator {\n    private static final Long MS_PER_HOUR = 60L * 60L * 1000L;\n\n    public static Id defaultBusinessHoursId() {\n        return [SELECT Id FROM BusinessHours WHERE IsDefault = true LIMIT 1].Id;\n    }\n\n    public static Datetime dueDate(Id businessHoursId, Datetime startTime, Integer workingHours) {\n        if (businessHoursId == null || startTime == null || workingHours == null || workingHours < 0) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException('Business hours, start time and a non-negative duration are required');\n        }\n        return BusinessHours.add(businessHoursId, startTime, workingHours * MS_PER_HOUR);\n    }\n\n    public static Decimal elapsedWorkingHours(Id businessHoursId, Datetime startTime, Datetime endTime) {\n        if (businessHoursId == null || startTime == null || endTime == null || endTime <= startTime) {\n            return 0;\n        }\n        Long ms = BusinessHours.diff(businessHoursId, startTime, endTime);\n        return Decimal.valueOf(ms).divide(MS_PER_HOUR, 2, System.RoundingMode.HALF_UP);\n    }\n}\n",
