    task: "Brightwell Energy's integration receives payloads with an unpredictable shape, e.g. {\"customer\":{\"address\":{\"postcode\":\"SS14 1AB\"}},\"meters\":[{\"mpan\":\"123\"}]}.\nWrite `public static Object getPath(String body, String path)` in class `PayloadReader`.\n- path is dot-separated; numeric segments index into arrays ('meters.0.mpan' -> '123')\n- Return null when any segment is missing, an index is out of range, or a segment hits a primitive\n- Blank body/path return null\n- Use JSON.deserializeUntyped",
    starter: "public with sharing class PayloadReader {\n    public static Object getPath(String body, String path) {\n        // TODO\n        return null;\n    }\n}\n",
    solution: "public with sharing class PayloadReader {\n    public static Object getPath(String body, String path) {\n        if (String.isBlank(body) || String.isBlank(path)) return null;\n        Object current = JSON.deserializeUntyped(body);\n        for (String segment : path.split('\\\\.')) {\n            if (current instanceof Map<String, Object>) {\n                current = ((Map<String, Object>) current).get(segment);\n            } else if (current instanceof List<Object>) {\n                if (!segment.isNumeric()) return null;\n                List<Object> items = (List<Object>) current;\n                Integer index = Integer.valueOf(segment);\n                if (index >= items.size()) return null;\n                current = items[index];\n            } else {\n                return null;\n            }\n            if (current == null) return null;\n        }\n        return current;\n    }\n}\n",
    checks: [{ re: /deserializeUntyped\(/i, msg: "Uses JSON.deserializeUntyped" }, { re: /Map<\s*String\s*,\s*Object\s*>/i, msg: "Navigates Map<String, Object> nodes" }, { re: /List<\s*Object\s*>/i, msg: "Navigates List<Object> nodes" }, { re: /split\(/i, msg: "Splits the path into segments" }, { re: /instanceof/i, msg: "Checks node types with instanceof" }],
