    solution: "public with sharing class LeaderboardEntry implements Comparable {\n    public String repName { get; private set; }\n    public Integer points { get; private set; }\n\n    public LeaderboardEntry(String repName, Integer points) {\n        this.repName = repName == null ? '' : repName;\n        this.points = points == null ? 0 : points;\n    }\n\n    public Integer compareTo(Object other) {\n        LeaderboardEntry that = (LeaderboardEntry) other;\n        if (this.points != that.points) {\n            return this.points > that.points ? -1 : 1;\n        }\n        return this.repName.toLowerCase().compareTo(that.repName.toLowerCase());\n    }\n}\n\npublic with sharing class Leaderboard {\n    public static List<String> topReps(List<LeaderboardEntry> entries, Integer n) {\n        List<String> names = new List<String>();\n        if (entries == null || entries.isEmpty() || n == null || n <= 0) return names;\n        List<LeaderboardEntry> sorted = entries.clone();\n        sorted.sort();\n        for (Integer i = 0; i < Math.min(n, sorted.size()); i++) {\n            names.add(sorted[i].repName);\n        }\n        return names;\n    }\n}\n",
